  "description": "Stimulsoft Dashboards.BLAZOR allows developers to implement the required data visualization and their own infographics using .NET 6, .NET 7, .NET 8 and native Blazor report engine. The product has the ability to apply the necessary filters and sorting, aggregate data, perform calculations of any complexity. The advantage of the product is its versatility - the ability to create dashboards for any sphere of your business, finance, sales, industry etc.",
